research/audit/wave11-A6-task.md:1:# Wave 11 Audit-Alpha task — A6 only
research/audit/wave11-A6-task.md:3:Act as the independent Wave 11 Audit-Alpha under `briefs/audit-alpha.md` and the complete `AUDIT-WORKFLOW.md`. You are GPT 5.6 Sol through Codex at `xhigh` with the 1,000,000-token context window. Recover the durable run from disk before acting; never trust a summary in place of the current artifacts. The user requires autonomous operation: never ask for shell-command or edit permission. Use the already-approved host routes for in-scope dispatches, or record a genuine blocker.
research/audit/wave11-A6-task.md:5:Do not start until the orchestrator has marked Wave 11 A4 complete and supplied final `post-A4` artifacts. Then:
research/audit/wave11-A6-task.md:8:2. Audit every final Wave 11 manifest edge, every exact out-of-scope target needed to license it, every changed-interface consumer in the impact template, every same-batch/cross-pair edge, and every proof-bearing top-100 spine item routed to this wave. No sampling is permitted. Apply the binding 30-second threshold and record nonfatal debt without editing it.
research/audit/wave11-A6-task.md:12:6. You may make only Alpha-authorized A6 fatal/major repairs justified by your whole-scope read. Every Alpha item/page repair requires a fresh exact-final independent Terra certification and consumer-impact refresh. Remove stale stamps on edited items, update exact contracts, and report every edited id; pure retags never enter the rejudge set.
research/audit/wave11-A6-task.md:13:7. Write the durable A6 record and all required receipts: `wave11-alpha.md`, `wave11-published-repairs.md`, `wave11-rejudge-targets.json` with `mode: published-audit-repair-targets`, final impact/spine/genrisk/risk receipts, certifier/refuter archives, and exact current contracts/manifests as required. Take no touch snapshots; the orchestrator owns stage snapshots.
research/audit/wave11-A6-task.md:14:8. Run the isolated and authoritative A6 gates available to you and leave the tree quiescent. Do not run A7, judges, A8, A9, A10, commit, or push. Handoff the exact A7 ids and any blocker.
